The '''Intimidation Artifact''' is a {{Rare}} [[Accessory]] and an upgraded form of the {{Item|Intimidation Ring}}. It prevents mobs at or below level {{Green|25}} from attacking the player.

== Obtaining ==
=== Shop Purchase ===
The '''Intimidation Artifact''' can be purchased from the {{NPCSprite|Fear Mongerer}} for {{Item|Purple Candy|amount=100}} and an {{Item|Intimidation Ring|amount=1}} during the [[Spooky Festival]].

== Usage ==
{{ItemInfo
|type = Accessory
|rarity = rare
|special_effect = Monsters at or below level {{Green|25}} will no longer target you.
}}

While the '''Intimidation Artifact''' prevents most mobs at or below level 25 from attacking the player, some mobs are not affected. While not specified by the game, it is likely this behavior is intended.

These mobs include:
* {{level|15}} {{MobSprite|Minos Hunter}} 
* All [[Sea Creatures]]

